maluos-estate (0.10.1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Depends on polkitd. The node service starts its helper units (the
    updates unit, an agent's unit, the restart helper) through the polkit
    rule this package ships; the server image carries no polkit, so on a
    server every such start was refused with "Access denied". Found by
    the first boot test of the restart helper.

