maluos-estate (0.10.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Phase 14 slice 4d (docs/phase14-watching-agents.md): three more node
    actions, each a fixed verb with checked arguments, each only if this
    node's actions.allow names it.
    restart_unit: a unit of this node's own list (actions.units in
    estate.yaml, else the list of the host's role; maluctl estate actions
    units …). The node service starts maluos-estate-restart@<unit>.service,
    a root helper that checks the list again before it restarts anything.
    postgres_cancel, postgres_terminate: one client backend by pid, as the
    node service's own role (pg_signal_backend: never a superuser's
    session); the pid is an integer or nothing runs.
  * A bare node (a database server) allows apply_updates, restart_unit,
    postgres_cancel and postgres_terminate by default; other nodes gain
    restart_unit. reboot stays off unless the node's owner allows it.
  * The mock office queues an action with arguments (/mock/action) and
    lists the actions (/mock/actions).

