maluos-estate (0.7.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * The estate behind a proxy (docs/phase13-estate-behind-a-proxy.md): the
    hub is whichever member the others reach on one UDP port, and the role
    is a setting of the running estate: `maluctl estate overlay hub
    HOST:PORT | off` (POST /api/v1/estate/overlay/hub) takes, moves or
    releases it without a leave; the overlay service follows a moved hub
    (addresses pruned to the one given, a demoted hub's listen port given
    up, `since` in the state); `overlay status` and the report give a
    verdict from the handshakes when the UDP port does not reach the hub;
    `join --hub` and `overlay hub` warn on an endpoint host that does not
    resolve; the mock office serves overlay/hub.

