maluos-estate (0.2.1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * maluos-overlay.service keeps its state in its own directory,
    /var/lib/maluos/overlay (StateDirectory): sharing /var/lib/maluos/estate
    with the daemon let systemd re-own that directory to root when the overlay
    started, after which the daemon (maluos-estate) could not write state.json
    and `maluctl estate status` saw no heartbeat.
  * mock office: a fake spoke (--overlay-spoke) is allocated its address after
    the node and desk tables exist; it crashed the mock at start.

